  "extractionNotes": "Stillbirth on 2026-02-21; sex undetermined, so no stillbirth card went to the registry office and the proof is the special doctor/midwife certificate issued when no birth act exists. The ZAM asks for maternity leave 2026-02-21..2026-04-18 (57 days, one day more than 8 weeks); the ZUS memo repeats the claimed period. The ZUS titles screen with the note that maternity benefit was granted shows title 1240 for 2026-02-21..2026-04-17 (exactly 56 days), while the contribution-exempt 0590 row runs to 2026-04-18; the 1240 period is taken as the granted period. No decision on the extra day. ZUS insurance memo (created 2026-03-09, answered 2026-03-10): 0590 from 2023-02-08, voluntary sickness from 2023-05-19; declared bases 2025-02..2026-01 (minimum bases; 2025-06 partial after a sickness spell; 2025-12 flagged as a contribution-holiday month); no debt on 2026-02-21; base below 60% of the forecast wage (last such month 2026-01). Earlier benefits listed in the memo are summarised as two 2025 sickness spells (benefit-type codes not decoded; 2021-2023 spells including a previous child's 52-week maternity omitted). The claimant filed a statement that she has no other title, asking for the benefit to be raised to the 1000 zł floor; whether the top-up was applied is not printed. Base and amounts not printed; 100% rate expected."
